# Determinism is a hard requirement here: two builds of an unchanged
# repository must produce byte-identical graph.json, and the fixture
# repository must produce identical commit SHAs on every machine. Line-ending
# translation on checkout would undermine both, so normalise to LF everywhere
# and let nothing depend on the platform git happens to be running on.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
